                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The affordable healthcare tax credits are set to expire. Democrats are ready to vote to extend them for three more years\u2014but Republicans would rather let prices skyrocket.\n\nAnd no one stands to lose more than Florida and Miami-Dade County.",
