                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If we don\u2019t extend the healthcare tax credits that millions on the Affordable Care Act marketplace rely on, no one gets hit harder than Floridians.\n\nCAN YOU BELIEVE THE TOP 10 DISTRICTS IN THE NATION WHO RELY ON THE AFFORDABLE CARE ACT ARE ALL IN ONE STATE \u2014 FLORIDA? https://t.co/hTwxjRY2fM",
